<title>USA: U.S. December S&amp;P 500 futures rally to 751.00.</title>
<headline>U.S. December S&amp;P 500 futures rally to 751.00.</headline>
<text>
<p>Dec 9 - U.S. December Standard and Poor's 500 futures rallied to 751.00, with buy-stops seen above 749.30 and buy programs when Dec exceeded 2.00 points premium to cash. Volume brisk with good broad-based buying seen. Resistance was now seen at 759.95, traders said.</p>
<p>((Derivatives Desk(312)408-8750/Email:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
